# Pixiv remote rule set for Loon
#
# This file intentionally contains match rules only. The outbound policy is
# assigned by the [Remote Rule] entry in the main Loon configuration.

# Core Pixiv services: website, app/API, login/OAuth, and image delivery.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pixiv.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pximg.net

# Official related services (remove these four lines if only the main Pixiv
# service is needed).
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,fanbox.cc
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pixivision.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pixiv.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,pixivsketch.net
